*.tsbuildinfo

# generated session state — re-derived from ground truth every session start (scripts/boot-contract.mjs)
state/
# writer lease — MACHINE-LOCAL advisory lock (scripts/writer-lease.mjs, GPTW-04/36/42); a COMMITTED
# lease would race itself across checkouts — the exact bug it exists to prevent. Explicit line kept
# even though state/ already covers it, so narrowing state/ can never silently start committing leases.
state/writer-lease.local.json
